      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_3",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_time_area",
            area: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22time_area%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2220-27%2C21-27%2C21-27%2C21-27%2C21-27%2C22-27%2C23%2C25-27%2C27%22%2C%22y%22%3A%221%20%20%20%20%2C2%20%20%20%20%2C3%20%20%20%20%2C4%20%20%20%20%2C5%20%20%20%20%2C6%20%20%20%20%2C7%20%2C7%20%20%20%20%2C8%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22time%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22underground%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22Underground%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22misc%2Ftime-schedules%2Fschedule-underground.png%22%2C%22lawful_bonus%22%3A%22-25%22%2C%22red%22%3A%22-60%22%2C%22green%22%3A%22-45%22%2C%22blue%22%3A%22-25%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "STORE_UNIT_VAR_store",
            kill: "no",
            id: "Tallin",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "old_tallin_level",
            value: "$STORE_UNIT_VAR_store.level",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "old_tallin_level",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "0,1",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                    variable: "new_tallin_type",
                    value: "Sergeant",
                    mode: "value",
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 2,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                    variable: "new_tallin_type",
                    value: "Lieutenant",
                    mode: "value",
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:transform_unit",
            id: "Tallin",
            transform_to: "$new_tallin_type",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:heal_unit",
            moves: "full",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Tallin%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Tallin",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("So I see you stinky-midgets and human-worms finally mustered up the courage to face me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Who are you, and what do you want?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I am Emperor Rakshas and by the power of my sword, I lead the orcish people. I am here simply finishing the job Khazg Black-Tusk started years ago — the conquest of Knalga."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Khazg tried and failed, and if you repeat his folly you will soon join him in the Land of the Dead!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Pah! I would like to see those cowardly dwarves try their treachery on me as they did on the Black-Tusk! In any case, those dwarves will soon be groveling at my feet and equipping my people with the finest weapons. With the dwarvish weapons, and the wealth of Knalga, nothing will be able to stop us. Even that little backwater that you humans call Wesnoth will be nothing but a burnt out, pillaged wreck before long."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Boy, this guy sure has delusions of grandeur."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("I am not so sure it’s that simple, Tallin. Think back to those orcs at the Dwarven Doors, and those wolves on the way to the mines; they were both saying something about ‘The Master’."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Yeah?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("Well, unless I miss my guess, dreamy fellow would be him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Well, if that is so, then it’s time to end this menace once and for all! Fall on them, boys!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 3,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "0-8",
            y: "9-26",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("So! Your forces are managing to advance upon me? Very impressive, but it shall do you no good. KNIGHTS!!"),
          },
